{
    "title": "Partiful: Fun Party Invites",
    "description": "*Winner of Google's \"Best App of 2024\"*\r\n\r\nPartiful is the ultimate tool to create, manage, and share events. From birthdays to dinner parties, Partiful helps you plan for every occassion \u2014 no stress, no hassle.\r\n\r\nACTUALLY FUN EVENT PAGES\r\n\r\n- Create pages for any event \u2014 birthdays, pregames, kickbacks, dinners, game nights, group trips, and more\r\n- Choose themes, effects, and posters to make your event stand out\r\n- Guests can RSVP, comment, and share photos or GIFs\r\n\r\nINVITE FRIENDS FROM ANYWHERE\r\n\r\n- Send event invites with a simple link \u2014 **no app download required!**\r\n- Customize your RSVP settings for private or public events\r\n- Save and reuse guest lists for future events or invite new friends easily\r\n\r\nSHARE UPDATES AND PHOTOS\r\n\r\n- Keep everyone in the loop with text blasts and event updates\r\n- Share comments and photos on the event page \u2014 guests can reply and add their own\r\n- Build a shared **Photo Roll** to remember the best moments\r\n\r\nFIND THE PERFECT DATE\r\n\r\n- Use polls to check availability and find the best time for everyone\r\n- Guests can RSVP to multiple dates, and you select the final choice\r\n- Automatic updates ensure everyone stays informed\r\n\r\nSTREAMLINE EVENT PLANNING\r\n\r\n- Add your Venmo or CashApp to collect funds for group activities\r\n- Set attendee limits and manage waitlists automatically\r\n- Use questionnaires to gather details like dietary preferences or location preferences\r\n\r\nKEEP IT SIMPLE OR GO BIG\r\n\r\n- Create a page in seconds for casual gatherings like dinners or game nights\r\n- Leave details TBD and finalize plans later with your guests\r\n\r\nTRACK OF YOUR SOCIAL LIFE\r\n\r\n- Manage all your events \u2014 hosted or attended \u2014 in one place\r\n- Sync with Google, Apple, or Outlook calendars to stay organized\r\n- Discover Open Invite events hosted by your **Mutuals** and expand your circle\r\n\r\nSHOW OFF YOUR PARTY PROFILE\r\n\r\n- Create a profile with a bio, photo, and links to your socials\r\n- Track how many events you\u2019ve hosted and attended\r\n- Keep track of your Mutuals (the people you\u2019ve partied with)\r\n\r\n......\r\n\r\nGot questions or fun party ideas? DM us on Instagram @partiful or email hello@partiful.com.\r\n\r\nFollow us on TikTok, Instagram, and Twitter @partiful\r\n\r\n......\r\n\r\nEvent planning app, RSVP management, Party hosting, Group events, Schedule events, Guest list organizer, Social networking app, Event updates, Poll your friends, Photo sharing",
